{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin",
  "talk_select_select.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "But nobody would help, would they?": "",
  "You kiddin'? Of course they helped.\nWe burst in there ready to bust heads.": "",
  "What, you kiddin'? Of course they helped.\nWe all busted our way into Amour.": "",
  "But I thought nobody else\nwent in or out of Amour.": "",
  "Wait. I thought nobody else\nwent in or out of Amour.": "",
  "What, you mean 'cause the camera\ndidn't see anyone?": "",
  "Heh. Funny thing, that. Turns out you can't\nget seen if the camera's broken.": "",
  "See, we didn't go in the front way. We went round\nthe back where the camera was broken.": "",
  "The back alley was our ticket in.": "",
  "That was our ticket into Amour.": "",
  "So you really went inside?": "",
  "Through the back alley?\nYou were in Amour?": "",
  "Yup. Not a soul in the house, though.\nTrust me, we searched the whole damn joint.": "",
  "And when was that?": "",
  "Just after midnight, I suppose.": "",
  "Just after midnight.": "",
  "Right when the prosecution says\nHamura was laying into Kume.": "",
  "According to the prosecution, that's when Hamura\nwas kicking Kume around in Amour.": "",
  "If you're telling the truth,\nthat's a clear contradiction.": "",
  "If you're telling the truth,\ntheir story doesn't hold up.": "",
  "Hmph. Who gives a shit\nwhat the prosecution says?": "",
  "Hamura killed Kume, and that's that.\nAin't no other way!": "",
  "I told you. Hamura killed Kume!\nAin't no other way!": "",
  "Maybe so. But the police\nstill need to hear your story.": "",
  "Maybe so. Still, if they want the truth,\nthe police need to hear your story.": "",
  "If you could just testify to that...": "",
  "So if you wouldn't mind taking the stand...": "",
  "You gotta be kidding me.\nWhy the fuck would I do that, huh?": "",
  "You fuckin' kiddin'?\nWhy the fuck would I do that, huh?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Can't force him to testify.\nNothing I can do about that.)</color>": "",
  "...It was worth a try.": "",
  "Heh. Nice work.": "",
  "I think I get it.": "",
  "So Murase busts into Amour,\nand who does he find? Absolutely nobody.": "",
  "So Murase and his crew... They bust into Amour\naround midnight, and find nobody.": "",
  "Yup. Captain Hamura said he kicked Kume out,\nthen hit the sauna right around midnight.": "",
  "Yup. Captain Hamura said he kicked Kume out,\nthen went for a quick steam right around midnight.": "",
  "The stories match up.": "",
  "You really think he's innocent?": "",
  "So Captain Hamura's clear?\nYou think he's really innocent?": "",
  "Not sure. Our next step is finding\nproof he was at that sauna.": "",
  "Can't say until we have proof\nthat he was at the sauna.": "",
  "Guess that's that. Well, I'm pooped.\nHow 'bout we call it here for tonight?": "",
  "Well, guess that's it for tonight, then.\nI think we better call it here. More tomorrow?": "",
  "Good call.": "",
  "I'll see you tomorrow, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Okay...\nI'll see you tomorrow, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Murase saw your face, yeah?\nYou should be careful 'round town.": "",
  "One more thing. Murase saw your face, yeah?\nYou should be careful 'round town.": "",
  "(I got all I need from Murase.\nI should probably report back to Shintani.)": "",
  "Hey, you find anything?": "",
  "Hey. You find anything?": "",
  "Sure did. Murase spilled the beans over\nat the Kyorei hideout. Place called KJ Art.": "",
  "Managed to find Murase at the Kyorei's hideout.\nIt's in the KJ Art building, on the upper floors.": "",
  "And you made it out of there\nin one piece? Incredible.": "",
  "And you made it out of there in one piece?\nYou sure you're okay?": "",
  "All in a day's work...\nShintani-sensei.": "",
  "So. According to Murase,\nAmour was empty at midnight on the 3rd.": "",
  "So at midnight on the 3rd, Murase's account says\nAmour was totally empty.": "",
  "That directly contradicts the prosecution's assertion\nthat Hamura was beating Kume to death at the time.": "",
  "That's a direct contradiction. The prosecution asserts\nthat Hamura was beating Kume to death at the time.": "",
  "Wow, that's a helluva find.\nBut is Murase gonna testify?": "",
  "Wow, what a find...\nSo, then? Is Murase gonna testify?": "",
  "It's not that easy.": "",
  "Nah, it's not that easy.": "",
  "...It never is.": "",
  "Either way, Murase's telling the truth.\nI found something that backs his story up.": "",
  "But it's clear Murase's telling the truth.\nHis story lines up with what we found.": "",
  "This is Amour, three hours after\nHamura took Kume. Midnight.": "",
  "This is Amour, three hours after Hamura took Kume.\nJust around midnight.": "",
  "Take a good look at\nthe edge of the screen.": "",
  "Watch the bottom of the screen.\nShouldn't take long.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So they saw the camera,\nthen headed to the back door.)</color>": "",
  "You don't see any of 'em go inside,\nso I thought nothing of it.": "",
  "They don't go into Amour from here,\nso I figured it was useless.": "",
  "But the stories match up. Murase and his guys\nwent to Amour to take Kume back.": "",
  "And they left empty-handed.": "",
  "Sounds like we need to talk to Captain Hamura.\nThere are too many unanswered questions.": "",
  "Sounds like we need to talk to Captain Hamura.\nIt's about time we got some answers.": "",
  "Agreed.\nI'll set up another visit.": "",
  "Give me a call once you do.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nYou spoke to Mafuyu, yes?": "",
  "Huh? Yeah, why do you ask?": "",
  "Hm...? Yeah, why?": "",
  "She seemed happy.\nIt had been a while since she last saw you.": "",
  "Mafuyu... seemed happy.\nIt's been a while since she saw you.": "",
  "Oh. Cool?": "",
  "But she looked sad, too.": "",
  "Sad? Wonder why.": "",
  "As do I.\nSee you later.": "",
  "Why indeed.\nSee you.": "",
  "Hey, Hamura's ready for us.\nTake a cab over to the Kamurocho Police Station.": "",
  "It's Shintani. Hamura's ready for us.\nTake a cab over to the Kamurocho Police Station.": "",
  "Will do. Thanks.": "",
  "When the fuck am I\ngetting outta here, Tak?": "",
  "Don't ask me.\nShintani-sensei's your lawyer, remember?": "",
  "Hamura-san.\nI've got something to show you.": "",
  "December 3rd. 11:55 PM.": "",
  "A Kyorei man by the name of Murase\ncomes to Amour to rescue Kume.": "",
  "Not wanting to be seen by the cameras,\nhe goes in through the back.": "",
  "Murase said there wasn't a soul in sight.": "",
  "Murase said there wasn't\na soul in sight.": "",
  "Well yeah.\nI'd already hopped over to the sauna.": "",
  "Well, yeah.\nI hopped over to the sauna for a quick steam.": "",
  "And what did you do with Kume?": "",
  "I already told you,\nI threw him out the back.": "",
  "And before that?": "",
  "Around 10:00, you kicked everyone else out\nso you could be alone with Kume.": "",
  "Around 10:00, you kicked everyone else out of the club.\nAll so you could be alone with Kume.": "",
  "I have testimony to back that up.": "",
  "Why'd you do it though?": "",
  "But why'd you do it?": "",
  "What can I say, I guess Kume\nreminded me of an old friend.": "",
  "Well... It was that Kume guy.\nReminded me of an old friend.": "",
  "I must've been feeling nostalgic.\nWho knows, though. I was pretty plastered.": "",
  "Maybe I was feeling kinda nostalgic?\nYou gotta remember, I was pretty plastered.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(He's suddenly getting evasive. Even pulled the\n\"I was too drunk to remember\" card.)</color>": "",
  "That so? Did you need to kick\neveryone out just for that?": "",
  "Is that all? You kicked everyone out\njust for that?": "",
  "I told you, I was drunk.\nWho knows what I was thinking.": "",
  "I don't know, I was blackout drunk!": "",
  "You seem to remember other parts clearly,\nthough. Like when you left the club.": "",
  "Yet somehow you remember pretty clearly\nwhen you left the club.": "",
  "What're you getting at?": "",
  "For a so-called innocent man with an alibi...": "",
  "For a so-called innocent man with an alibi,\neven if you didn't kill Kume...": "",
  "...Your story has an awful lot of holes.": "",
  "You wouldn't hide something\nfrom us, would you?": "",
  "You're not hiding something\nfrom us, right?": "",
  "'Course not.": "",
  "Something like...\nThe true killer's identity?": "",
  "I said I'm not hiding shit!": "",
  "Now get the hell out there\nand prove my alibi!": "",
  "I was at the sauna all night long.\nProve that and I'm in the clear!": "",
  "I need to have a backup plan\nin case your alibi doesn't pan out.": "",
  "There's always a chance your alibi won't hold water.\nI'll need a backup plan just in case.": "",
  "But I can't help you if you're gonna\nhide things from your lawyer.": "",
  "But... I can't help you if you keep\nhiding stuff from me.": "",
  "You're suspected of abducting a rival clan member,\ngouging his eyes out, and dumping him in an alleyway.": "",
  "Abducting a rival clan member, gouging his eyes out\nand dumping the body...": "",
  "They'll lock you up and toss the key\nif we can't win this.": "",
  "You'll hang for this if we can't\nclear your name.": "",
  "Has that thought even\ncrossed your mind?": "",
  "That doesn't seem to faze you.": "",
  "Or are all yakuza just that fearless\nin the face of a life sentence?": "",
  "Are all yakuza this fearless?": "",
  "Fear has nothing to do with it.\nBut like hell am I gonna beg you to save me.": "",
  "Fear has nothing to do with it. I'm just not\ngonna bow down and beg you to save me.": "",
  "Then who would you beg?": "",
  "Then who <font_kind=yakuza_italic>would</font_kind> you beg?": "",
  "None of your business.": "",
  "...Anyone else.": "",
  "It's only a matter of time, Hamura.\nI'll figure out what you're hiding.": "",
  "It's only a matter of time.\nI'll figure out what you're hiding.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami!": "",
  "Yo. Sounds like you've been busy.": "",
  "Had a little chat with Hamura.\nWasn't real productive.": "",
  "Had a little chat with Hamura.\nDidn't get much out of him, though.": "",
  "Figures.": "",
  "Too bad.": "",
  "He's keeping something from us. There might\nbe more to this case than we thought.": "",
  "Hamura's keeping something from us.\nThere might be more to this case than we thought.": "",
  "So what, you telling me we hit a dead end?": "",
  "So what, you telling me we're stuck?": "",
  "More or less.\nI need more to work with.": "",
  "Specifically?": "",
  "More like what?": "",
  "Like what Hamura and Kume did after\nleaving Amour. Eyewitness testimony.": "",
  "We don't have time to scour\nthe city for leads, though.": "",
  "Hey, how much money you got?": "",
  "Tak... You got any cash?": "",
  "How much you need?": "",
  "Mm? How much?": "",
  "You'll need 30k or so.": "",
  "30 grand oughta do.": "",
  "I've got this friend, a local detective on the force.\nHe'll tell you anything for the right price.": "",
  "I've got this friend. Local Kamurocho detective.\nHe'll tell you anything for the right price.": "",
  "Anything?": "",
  "Anything. Guy's an informant. You want the dirt\nonly cops have access to, he's the guy you hit up.": "",
  "Guy's an informant. He's lifting the lid on police investigations\nleft and right. Maybe he's got the info you need.": "",
  "So you're saying he's a dirty cop?": "",
  "I see... A dirty cop, huh?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's an ex-yakuza for you.\nUnderground police info sounds useful.)</color>": "",
  "Name's Ayabe.\nHe's a regular over at Tender.": "",
  "Really.": "",
  "At Tender?": "",
  "Yeah, surprised you've never run into him there.\nIt's where everyone goes to meet him.": "",
  "Yeah. Shouldn't be too hard to find.\nEveryone usually meets up with him at Tender.": "",
  "Try asking your pal Masuda.": "",
  "Just ask Masuda-san.": "",
  "Hey, you have a sec?": "",
  "Masuda, you have a sec?": "",
  "Of course. What do you need?": "",
  "I'm looking for a detective. Ayabe.\nYou know him?": "",
  "I'm looking for an Ayabe...?\nYou know him?": "",
  "Sure do. He hasn't been by\nin a few days, though. Why?": "",
  "Sure do. He hasn't been by\nin a few days, though. You need Ayabe-san?": "",
  "Ah, damn.\nGuess I came at the wrong time.": "",
  "Ah, damn. Guess I've just got\nbad timing...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I'll have to come back later.\nSure hope this guy is worth the trouble...)</color>": "",
  "It's okay. I'll let him know\nyou were looking for him.": "",
  "Why don't you have a drink or two\nin the meantime? First one's on me.": "",
  "In the meantime, why don't you sit and have a drink?\nJust one, even. It's on me.": "",
  "What's all this?": "",
  "Hm? Why?": "",
  "Just buttering you up. Remember when I mentioned\nsomeone who had a job for you?": "",
  "The other day, I mentioned I had a customer\nwho had a job for you. Remember?": "",
  "Yeah, what of it?": "",
  "I guess so.\nWhat's your point?": "",
  "Well, turns out they won't have\none for you after all. Sorry.": "",
  "Unfortunately, it turns out\nthey want to cancel.": "",
  "Apparently the client was trying to get back\nat some yakuza who sucker punched him.": "",
  "The way I heard it, the client was trying to\nget back at some yakuza who punched him.": "",
  "And he wanted me to do... what?": "",
  "Yikes. What could I even do about that?": "",
  "Not sure.\nDoesn't matter now anyway.": "",
  "Why, did he go all vigilante on him?": "",
  "Did they hit the guy back?\nThat wouldn't turn out well.": "",
  "Not exactly.\nSounds like the yakuza ended up behind bars.": "",
  "Not exactly... Sounds like the yakuza\nended up behind bars.": "",
  "For killing a man\nand gouging his eyes out.": "",
  "Huh? Wait a second...": "",
  "Huh? Wait, that yakuza was...": "",
  "Captain Hamura. Surprised?": "",
  "A yakuza around here on the 3rd, huh?\nI did hear a host got smacked down that night.": "",
  "Anything else you can tell me?": "",
  "I think I'd better hear the rest of this.": "",
  "Sorry, but that's all I've got.\nYou'll have to ask the guy directly.": "",
  "Sorry, but that's all I've got.\nAsk the client for more details.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If the yakuza who punched the host by the sauna\nwas Hamura...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Then that might help establish his alibi\nthat he went into Sauna Goten afterwards.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I should ask the host.)</color>": "",
  "Who is he?": "",
  "Man by the name of Seiya.": "",
  "He's a host over at Club Stardust on\nTenkaichi Street. That's where I'd look.": "",
  "He works over at Club Stardust on\nTenkaichi Street. One of their hosts.": "",
  "You wanna find an informant\nby the name of Ayabe.": "",
  "Your buddy over at Tender\nshould know more.": "",
  "Masuda over at Tender\nshould know more.": "",
  "You got a minute?": "",
  "Depends. Whaddya need?": "",
  "Huh? Whaddya need?": "",
  "I'm looking for someone who works here.\nThink I could talk to Seiya for a sec?": "",
  "I'm looking for a host by the name of Seiya.\nCan you go get him for me?": "",
  "Seiya-san, huh?": "",
  "Seiya-san?": "",
  "No can do. Not today.": "",
  "Ah... I'm afraid he's not here.": "",
  "Is he off today?": "",
  "What, took the day off?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I think I get it.": "คิดว่าเข้าใจแล้วนะ",
  "Good call.": "ความคิดดี",
  "'Course not.": "แน่นอนอยู่แล้ว",
  "None of your business.": "ไม่ใช่ธุระอะไรของแก",
  "Figures.": "เป็นไปตามคาด",
  "Anything?": "อะไรก็ได้เลยเหรอ?",
  "Really.": "งั้นเหรอ",
  "What's all this?": "นี่มันอะไรกันเนี่ย?",
  "Hm? Why?": "หืม? ทำไมล่ะ?",
  "Who is he?": "นี่ใครกัน?",
  "You got a minute?": "มีเวลาสักครู่ไหม"
 }
}
